    "description": "API-23: Profile Update | API-24: Activity Feed | API-25: Flashcard Set Sharing | API-26: Sync Queue | API-27: Note Sharing & Auto-Message | API-28: Task Participant Management.\n\nRun order: 1. Login → 2. Profile Update → 3. Activity Feed → 4. Flashcard Sharing → 5. Sync Queue → 6. Note Sharing & Auto-Message → 7. Task Participant Management.\ntoken and flashcardSetId are auto-set by test scripts. Requires flashcardSetId from a prior session.",
